Research and Innovation Promotion Ordinance (RIPO)
SR 420.11 — Ordinance of 29 November 2013 the Federal Act on the Promotion of Research and Innovation (Research and Innovation Promotion Ordinance, RIPO).
|

:NOTE [links:https://fedlex.data.admin.ch/eli/cc/2013/814]
English is not an official language of the Swiss Confederation. This translation is provided for information purposes only and has no legal force.
English consolidation of 1 February 2026, which is also the date of the current binding text.

:INFO
Preamble
The Swiss Federal Council,
based on Articles 10 paragraph 4 second sentence and paragraph 6 third sentence, 15 paragraph 6, 16 paragraph 6 second sentence, 23 paragraph 2, 29 paragraph 2, 42 paragraphs 2 and 4, 47 paragraph 1 and 56 of the Federal Act of 14 December 2012 on the Promotion of Research and Innovation (RIPA), as well as on Article 1 paragraph 5 of the Federal Act of 17 June 2016 on the Swiss Innovation Agency (SIAA),
ordains:
|

:NOTE
SR 420.1
SR 420.2
Amended by No I of the O of 12 Dec. 2025, in force since 1 Feb. 2026 (AS 2025 861).

